Target Problem (your task):

\begin{restatable}{theorem}{main1}
	\label{thm:main1}
If \Cref{conj:skew} is true, then one cannot obtain $\omega = 2$ via STPP constructions in the family of groups $\mathbb{Z}_q^\ell$, where $q$ is a prime power.
